(
    why: "The game has one blueprint per dragon colour, element, energy, form or bloodline, none of them primary; the planner holds one entry for whichever is held.",
    entry: (key: "bloodrager/bloodline/draconic/breath-weapon", name: "Breath Weapon", summary: "From 8th level, a breath weapon shaped by your dragon: 1d6 energy per class level, Reflex save; once a day, twice at 16th, three times at 20th.", guide: "bloodrager#breath-weapon"),
)
